      ],
      "en": "Behold, we heard of it in Ephrathah. We found it in the field of Jaar.",
      "ko": "우리가 그것이 에브라다에 있다 함을 들었더니 나무 밭에서 찾았도다",
      "source_text_hash": "7a2eb158a28d6d72a27331661a01da410cbf88cac6dc98862c440b1a1cf4d39e",
      "translation_text_hash": "42ef8517d2e88b67c2c1a2bfe0ab607106607f2d72a4877368441d26680b1247",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
