      "en": "For the LORD has chosen Zion. He has desired it for his habitation.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 시온을 택하시고 자기 거처를 삼고자 하여 이르시기를",
      "source_text_hash": "2fcf78ec52bd0d5a16c0b00982ef17f149e54877300e8b1a3220f376eeb9cd88",
      "translation_text_hash": "4ade1783883461b215ddcd31ad0187673d3d6106a5b0ecc2c8cdf1ee3f4e2134",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와께서 시온을 택하시고 자기 거처를 삼고자 하여 이르시기를"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "4ade1783883461b215ddcd31ad0187673d3d6106a5b0ecc2c8cdf1ee3f4e2134"
      ]
    },
    {
